      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>In the name of the Compassionate</li>\n<li><i>&ldquo;Behold, God is my salvation,&rdquo; et[c.]</i></li>\n<li>The most illustrious master the <i>c(antor)</i>, the e[lder] (<i>may) God b(e your succor),</i></li>\n<li>is hereby informed that we [. . .]</li>\n<li>since [the tim]e of the poll-tax payments [. . .]</li>\n<li>in you [. . .] with him [. . .]</li>\n<li>that the bearer of this has with him. [Sta]nd</li>\n<li>by [him and a]ssist him and release them</li>\n<li>to him [imm]ediately, and do not make it neccesary [for us]</li>\n<li>to reprove you. Appear with [him]</li>\n<li>at once, with the money in hand.</li>\n<li>Beware of being disobedient.</li>\n<li>May God the ex(alted) be [your succor]</li>\n<li>and may He watch over you. <i>And peace.</i></li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
